## First test

An anonymous plan slot, proposed project and identified financing cannot merge
merely because geography or capacity is similar. The fixture leaves their links
unresolved unless evidence supports them.

## Actions and exit criteria

Retrieve every frozen Senegal census item with raw-byte/hash provenance;
extract candidates deterministically; review dispositions and admit only
supported canonical facts. Preserve source currency, lifecycle states, link
uncertainty, blocked routes and unknowns. Complete only when every census item
has a documented disposition and a clean replay reproduces the candidate set.

